  59:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *  1. We enter here shortly after start-up of E51 code by  the system
  60:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *  controller.
  61:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *  2. We are running on the E51 and all other cores  are in wfi.
  62:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *  3. The MSS PLL will be set to use default internal clock of 80MH
  63:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *  4. MSS peripherals including the I/O are in the default power on state
  64:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *
  65:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *
